    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/80e94630f7520fdfe8736f4c54f9aa3b.poster.avif?t=1731550588\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/80e94630f7520fdfe8736f4c54f9aa3b.webm?t=1731550588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/80e94630f7520fdfe8736f4c54f9aa3b.mp4?t=1731550588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a relaxing puzzle experience with Puzzle Checkers: The Rooks, a game inspired by the classic games of checkers and chess. Perfect for casual players seeking a relaxing yet challenging experience, with a minimalist environment that reinvents well-known mechanics from the classic games of Chess and Checkers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/35366ff7b4468185fcf26301f818e817.poster.avif?t=1731550588\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/35366ff7b4468185fcf26301f818e817.webm?t=1731550588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/35366ff7b4468185fcf26301f818e817.mp4?t=1731550588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 50 challenging hand-crafted levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique movement mechanics</strong>, combining rules from <strong>checkers and chess</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist</strong> and <strong>elegant environment</strong> for a relaxing experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Well-balanced difficulty curve</strong>, suitable for casual players</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/bc341a0f7e0ceb8be4f4e5071be0e476.poster.avif?t=1731550588\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/bc341a0f7e0ceb8be4f4e5071be0e476.webm?t=1731550588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/bc341a0f7e0ceb8be4f4e5071be0e476.mp4?t=1731550588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ideal for:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle enthusiasts looking for new brain challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual players who value relaxing yet intellectually stimulating experiences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chess and checkers aficionados eager for an innovative perspective on classic board games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone seeking an invigorating mental break in their daily routine</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/d3db198bcc8753217c0ad478e583640f.poster.avif?t=1731550588\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/d3db198bcc8753217c0ad478e583640f.webm?t=1731550588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/d3db198bcc8753217c0ad478e583640f.mp4?t=1731550588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your mind and relax your spirit with Puzzle Checkers: The Rooks - the ultimate puzzle for your leisure moments. Each level is a new opportunity to enhance your strategic thinking while enjoying a serene atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get Puzzle Checkers: The Rooks now and discover why simplicity and strategy form the perfect combination!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/80e94630f7520fdfe8736f4c54f9aa3b.poster.avif?t=1731550588\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/80e94630f7520fdfe8736f4c54f9aa3b.webm?t=1731550588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/80e94630f7520fdfe8736f4c54f9aa3b.mp4?t=1731550588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a relaxing puzzle experience with Puzzle Checkers: The Rooks, a game inspired by the classic games of checkers and chess. Perfect for casual players seeking a relaxing yet challenging experience, with a minimalist environment that reinvents well-known mechanics from the classic games of Chess and Checkers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/35366ff7b4468185fcf26301f818e817.poster.avif?t=1731550588\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/35366ff7b4468185fcf26301f818e817.webm?t=1731550588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/35366ff7b4468185fcf26301f818e817.mp4?t=1731550588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 50 challenging hand-crafted levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique movement mechanics</strong>, combining rules from <strong>checkers and chess</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist</strong> and <strong>elegant environment</strong> for a relaxing experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Well-balanced difficulty curve</strong>, suitable for casual players</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/bc341a0f7e0ceb8be4f4e5071be0e476.poster.avif?t=1731550588\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/bc341a0f7e0ceb8be4f4e5071be0e476.webm?t=1731550588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/bc341a0f7e0ceb8be4f4e5071be0e476.mp4?t=1731550588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ideal for:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle enthusiasts looking for new brain challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual players who value relaxing yet intellectually stimulating experiences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chess and checkers aficionados eager for an innovative perspective on classic board games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone seeking an invigorating mental break in their daily routine</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/d3db198bcc8753217c0ad478e583640f.poster.avif?t=1731550588\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/d3db198bcc8753217c0ad478e583640f.webm?t=1731550588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200200/extras/d3db198bcc8753217c0ad478e583640f.mp4?t=1731550588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your mind and relax your spirit with Puzzle Checkers: The Rooks - the ultimate puzzle for your leisure moments. Each level is a new opportunity to enhance your strategic thinking while enjoying a serene atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get Puzzle Checkers: The Rooks now and discover why simplicity and strategy form the perfect combination!</p>",
